.specstory/

# Artifact files are model-facing (see AGENTS.md, "Audience: AI agents").
# remark escapes `~`, `[`, `*`, and `_` for prose rendering, which a model
# reads as literal backslashes and can echo back into its output.
#
# Leading slashes anchor these to the top level — unanchored, /skills/ would
# also swallow docs/skills/, which is human-facing and must stay formatted.
/skills/
/instructions/
/prompts/
/agents/
AGENTS.md
